{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "apiVersion": "2",
  "configSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {},
    "required": [],
    "additionalProperties": false
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "id": "ccxt_environment",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "agent",
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Inspect and select existing pinned CCXT Python first; explicit prepare creates private dependencies only if unavailable. No startup downloads or API keys.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "action"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "const": "inspect"
              },
              {
                "type": "string",
                "const": "prepare"
              }
            ]
          },
          "python_path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Existing native Python executable",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "execution": "run",
      "effects": [
        "process",
        "plugin.state.write",
        "private-filesystem",
        "network-on-prepare"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "核验并选择现有依赖；仅显式 prepare 可能安装私有依赖。",
        "inputs": "{action:\"inspect\",python_path?} 检查给定/已选/私有/宿主/PATH Python；{action:\"prepare\",python_path?} 在无兼容环境时创建私有 venv。最小例 {action:\"inspect\"}。",
        "outputs": "ready:true 返回 python、实际 Python/库版本、reused、origin、downloads/audit；inspect 成功会保存私有 selection，随即可用。ready:false 返回 required 和 failures[{python,code}]。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "本机64位 Python>=3.11；库固定 ccxt 4.5.85。已有路径可直接传 python_path，不必先扫描磁盘。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "inspect 不下载；prepare 从官方 PyPI 安装到插件私有目录，不安装解释器、不改共享环境。失败根据缺失解释器、导入版本或具体网络错误选择现有路径/准备；重复同一失败不产生新证据。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "ccxt_environment"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ccxt_catalog",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "agent",
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "List saved public connection identities and supported exchanges without exposing proxy addresses or credentials; read-only, no Python or network requests.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["connections"],
        "properties": {
          "connections": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["exchange", "connection"],
              "properties": {
                "exchange": { "type": "string", "enum": ["kraken", "coinbase", "okx"] },
                "connection": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["id", "revision"],
                  "properties": {
                    "id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
                    "revision": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 }
                  },
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "发现已保存的公开连接身份并查看交易所、周期和边界；已有完整有效身份可直接复用。",
        "inputs": "{}；不需要 Python 或联网。",
        "outputs": "{connections:[{exchange,connection:{id,revision}}],exchanges:[\"kraken\",\"coinbase\",\"okx\"],library:\"4.5.85\",market:\"public spot\",timeframes,pollIntervalMs:1000,orders:false,apiKeys:false,coverage:\"partial/unknown\",closed}。connections 只列已保存身份，不返回代理地址或凭据；无存储时为空且不创建数据库。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "无。沿用已配置交易所时取 connections 中匹配的完整 connection，放入当前 data_providers 来源的 source.binding.connection，直接调用 market_instruments、market_read；不必查设置或扫描历史文件。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "此包不提供账户、下单或实盘成交能力；公开数据可用不代表可交易。",
          "保存的身份和静态支持范围不证明网络连通；目录只读，不选择默认、不创建或修改路由。同一交易所有多个路由时保留完整 revision，按已有明确身份选择，不能默认取第一项或改成直连。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "ccxt_catalog"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_bind",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Bind the declared market source to explicit connection configuration.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "connection": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "revision": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "id",
                  "revision"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "configuration": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "exchange": {
                    "enum": [
                      "kraken",
                      "coinbase",
                      "okx"
                    ]
                  },
                  "publicProxy": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "exchange"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            },
            "required": [],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "binding"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [
        "plugin.state.write"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "为宿主建立精确行情来源会话；不代表已取得报价。",
        "inputs": "{binding:{configuration:{exchange:\"kraken\"}}}；exchange=kraken|coinbase|okx。可加 credential-free HTTP(S) publicProxy；后续可用原样 connection:{id,revision} 恢复已保存路由。",
        "outputs": "{bindingId,connection:{id:\"ccxt:kraken\",revision:\"4.5.85\"},sourceId:\"ccxt:kraken:spot\",health:\"configured\",limitations}；代理路由 revision 为其摘要。只保存路由，不验证网络。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Agent 使用 data_providers({contract:\"sesame.market/1\"}) 返回的 sesame/ccxt#market 精确 ref，经 market_instruments 搜索/描述，再按任务使用 market_read 或 canvas_binding/canvas_apply；本 capability 仅供宿主数据适配层调用。",
          "ccxt_environment inspect 返回 ready:true 已保存选择；prepare 仅在依赖缺失时安装私有 CCXT 4.5.85。公开市场不需要 API Key。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "connection.id/revision 来自当前绑定或公开查询的 metadata.connection，不等于插件 source.revision。STALE_REVISION/CONNECTION_CHANGED 时重新取得当前身份；不能猜账号、版本或静默切换来源。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "market_bind"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_unbind",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Release this source binding and its snapshots.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "binding"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "closed": {
            "const": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "closed"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [
        "plugin.session.write"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "释放宿主创建的行情绑定。",
        "inputs": "{binding:<bind返回的含bindingId对象>}；例 {binding:{bindingId:\"host-owned-id\"}}。",
        "outputs": "{closed:true}；释放该绑定与其分页状态。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Agent 使用 data_providers({contract:\"sesame.market/1\"}) 返回的 sesame/ccxt#market 精确 ref，经 market_instruments 搜索/描述，再按任务使用 market_read 或 canvas_binding/canvas_apply；本 capability 仅供宿主数据适配层调用。",
          "ccxt_environment inspect 返回 ready:true 已保存选择；prepare 仅在依赖缺失时安装私有 CCXT 4.5.85。公开市场不需要 API Key。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "仅释放本次来源会话，不是平仓或停终端。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "market_unbind"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_searchInstruments",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Read actual source searchInstruments; source metadata includes coverage and time/precision limitations.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "query": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "assetClasses": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              },
              "venues": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "limit": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000
              },
              "cursor": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "limit"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "binding",
          "query",
          "page"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array"
          },
          "nextCursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "metadata"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [
        "process",
        "network"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "检索该明确来源的真实品种；返回 ref 是后续 instrument 的来源。",
        "inputs": "{binding:<bind结果>,query:{query:\"BTC\",assetClasses?,venues?},page:{limit:20,cursor?}}；limit≤500，cursor 仅沿用同一来源/过滤条件。",
        "outputs": "{items:[{ref:{sourceId,instrumentId},symbol,name,assetClass,venue?}],nextCursor?,metadata:{snapshotId?,consistency?,meta,connection?}}；空 items 仅是该次检索无匹配。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Agent 使用 data_providers({contract:\"sesame.market/1\"}) 返回的 sesame/ccxt#market 精确 ref，经 market_instruments 搜索/描述，再按任务使用 market_read 或 canvas_binding/canvas_apply；本 capability 仅供宿主数据适配层调用。",
          "ccxt_environment inspect 返回 ready:true 已保存选择；prepare 仅在依赖缺失时安装私有 CCXT 4.5.85。公开市场不需要 API Key。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "connection.id/revision 来自当前绑定或公开查询的 metadata.connection，不等于插件 source.revision。STALE_REVISION/CONNECTION_CHANGED 时重新取得当前身份；不能猜账号、版本或静默切换来源。",
          "仅公开现货。单次原生窗口 Kraken≤500、Coinbase/OKX≤300；扩大范围不能保证补齐历史。浮点转十进制文本不恢复上游精度。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "market_searchInstruments"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_describeInstrument",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Read actual source describeInstrument; source metadata includes coverage and time/precision limitations.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "instrument": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "sourceId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "instrumentId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "sourceId",
                  "instrumentId"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "instrument"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "limit": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000
              },
              "cursor": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "limit"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "binding",
          "query",
          "page"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array"
          },
          "nextCursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "metadata"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [
        "process",
        "network"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "读取具体品种的价格/数量单位、时间基准和支持周期。",
        "inputs": "{binding:<bind结果>,query:{instrument:{sourceId:\"ccxt:kraken:spot\",instrumentId:\"BTC/USD\"}}}；实际 instrument 用 search 返回 ref。",
        "outputs": "{items:[{ref,symbol,name,assetClass,price,quantity,volume,timeBasis,calendar,features,native}],metadata:{meta,connection?}}；unknown/unsupported 字段保留，features 决定支持的 spec。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Agent 使用 data_providers({contract:\"sesame.market/1\"}) 返回的 sesame/ccxt#market 精确 ref，经 market_instruments 搜索/描述，再按任务使用 market_read 或 canvas_binding/canvas_apply；本 capability 仅供宿主数据适配层调用。",
          "ccxt_environment inspect 返回 ready:true 已保存选择；prepare 仅在依赖缺失时安装私有 CCXT 4.5.85。公开市场不需要 API Key。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "仅公开现货。单次原生窗口 Kraken≤500、Coinbase/OKX≤300；扩大范围不能保证补齐历史。浮点转十进制文本不恢复上游精度。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "market_describeInstrument"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_queryBars",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Read actual source queryBars; source metadata includes coverage and time/precision limitations.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "instrument": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "sourceId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "instrumentId": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "sourceId",
                  "instrumentId"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "spec": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "timeframe": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "priceBasis": {
                    "enum": [
                      "bid",
                      "ask",
                      "mid",
                      "last"
                    ]
                  },
                  "adjustment": {
                    "enum": [
                      "none",
                      "forward",
                      "backward"
                    ]
                  },
                  "session": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "calendarRevision": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": true
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "timeframe",
                  "priceBasis",
                  "adjustment",
                  "session",
                  "calendarRevision"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "range": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "from": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "basis": {
                            "const": "utc"
                          },
                          "unixMs": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "basis",
                          "unixMs"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "basis": {
                            "const": "wall"
                          },
                          "authority": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "zone": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "fold": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "basis",
                          "authority",
                          "value"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "to": {
                    "anyOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "basis": {
                            "const": "utc"
                          },
                          "unixMs": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "basis",
                          "unixMs"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "basis": {
                            "const": "wall"
                          },
                          "authority": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "zone": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          },
                          "fold": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "basis",
                          "authority",
                          "value"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "from",
                  "to"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "includeForming": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "direction": {
                "enum": [
                  "forward",
                  "backward"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "instrument",
              "spec",
              "range"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "limit": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1000
              },
              "cursor": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "limit"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "binding",
          "query",
          "page"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array"
          },
          "nextCursor": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "metadata": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "metadata"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "execution": "immediate",
      "effects": [
        "process",
        "network"
      ],
      "usage": {
        "purpose": "读取有界历史柱和真实覆盖证据，供宿主查询/冻结。",
        "inputs": "{binding:<bind结果>,query:{instrument:<search.ref>,spec:<describe支持的spec>,range:{from:<SourceTime>,to:<SourceTime>},includeForming:false,direction:\"forward\"},page:{limit:100,cursor?}}。timeframe=1m|5m|15m|1h|1d，priceBasis=last，adjustment=none，session=all|default，calendarRevision:{status:\"unknown\"}。range 用 UTC {basis:\"utc\",unixMs}；区间 [from,to)。",
        "outputs": "{items:[{id,revision,openTime,endTime,open,high,low,close,volume,isClosed,closure}],nextCursor?,metadata:{seriesId,instrument,spec,coverage,snapshotId,consistency,meta,connection?}}；OHLC 是十进制字符串，volume 自带单位/未知状态；无 nextCursor 只说明本次快照分页结束。",
        "prerequisites": [
          "Agent 使用 data_providers({contract:\"sesame.market/1\"}) 返回的 sesame/ccxt#market 精确 ref，经 market_instruments 搜索/描述，再按任务使用 market_read 或 canvas_binding/canvas_apply；本 capability 仅供宿主数据适配层调用。",
          "ccxt_environment inspect 返回 ready:true 已保存选择；prepare 仅在依赖缺失时安装私有 CCXT 4.5.85。公开市场不需要 API Key。"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "coverage.complete:false 表示覆盖未获证明，可使用已返回的真实行并保留限制，不能改成 true 或当作空数据/请求失败。历史查询成功不证明实时订阅或图表渲染成功。",
          "仅公开现货。单次原生窗口 Kraken≤500、Coinbase/OKX≤300；扩大范围不能保证补齐历史。浮点转十进制文本不恢复上游精度。"
        ]
      },
      "binding": {
        "type": "native",
        "name": "market_queryBars"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "market_subscribeBars",
      "kind": "function",
      "consumers": [
        "host"
      ],
      "description": "Read actual source subscribeBars; source metadata includes coverage and time/precision limitations.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "binding": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "query": {
            "type": "object",
